WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.640
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:06.070
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:09.370
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.550
Well, well, well.
Have you ever kept a secret?

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:16.350
I know that keeping a secret
is not a nice thing to do.

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:18.520
But, I'm not allowed to
speak the truth no matter what.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.880
I have to do this for myself
and for people who I care about

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:23.920
and for something I want to protect.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:26.990
Miss Layla, I completely
understand how you feel.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.460
I completely understand.
I completely understand.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:35.440
<i>Dare mo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:35.440
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be someplace</i>

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.940
<i>Dokoka ni aru</i>

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.940
<i>It has to be somewhere</i>

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:45.640
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja nai</i>

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:45.640
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:00.000
<i>Saigo made yareru to ittetane</i>

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:00.000
<i>Remember how I used to say
I could make it to the end?</i>

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.370
<i>Kitto tsuyogatte itanda</i>

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.370
<i>I must have been pretending to be tough</i>

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:15.080
<i>Itsudatte muchabakka de
zutto karamawari de</i>

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:15.080
<i>Everything I did was reckless
and it never got me anywhere</i>

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:21.570
<i>Dakedo anata dake ga soba ni ita</i>

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:21.570
<i>But you alone were always beside me</i>

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:28.320
<i>Daremo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:28.320
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be somewhere</i>

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.930
<i>Aruki daseru</i>

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.930
<i>You can start going forward</i>

00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:36.470
<i>Koko kara nani kaga hajimaru</i>

00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:36.470
<i>From this moment, something will start</i>

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:38.500
<i>Shinjite itai</i>

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:38.500
<i>I want to believe that</i>

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:46.010
<i>Mada minu hikari yakusoku no
basho e to tsuzuite yuku</i>

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:46.010
<i>The light I haven't seen yet
is beaming toward the promised place</i>

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:56.480
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja naisa</i>

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:56.480
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:40.360
It started raining hard. Let's go, Sora.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.060
Okay.

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:58.510
Thanks to all you guys,

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:02.140
the number of visitors at our park
is increasing drastically.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.910
This is my way of showing gratitude.

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:08.060
Please enjoy as much as you like.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.620
Let's eat!

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.890
Who knew the owner
was such a nice person?

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.130
You never can judge people
by the way they look.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.000
I think he wants to say

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.490
"build up your stamina, and do a good job."

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.140
As I thought, you're sharp, Rosetta.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.170
That's tough.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:27.570
By the way, I don't see the Masked Star.

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:28.830
Eep!

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.750
If I remember right,

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.980
I think she was saying that she was
going to sickle and chain class.

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:34.240
Sickle and chain?

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.240
I see... That's too bad.

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:45.230
The Amazing Resolve Beneath the Mask

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:48.200
The Amazing Resolve Beneath the Mask

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:48.200
"The Amazing Resolve Beneath the Mask"

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:51.260
The Amazing Resolve Beneath the Mask

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:56.840
You received a bouquet.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:02.330
I wonder if it's from a fan who doesn't
know you're supposed to be in London now?

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:12.250
It's from Yuri.

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:13.150
What?

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.090
Are you enjoying hide-and-seek?

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.020
Miss Layla, please hurry.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.900
If you miss the six o'clock flight,

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.990
you'll not make tomorrow afternoon's filming.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.940
I understand. Thank you.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:34.710
I think you already looked
at the mail I sent you.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.480
The Masked Star shown
in the picture is Layla.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.210
Layla is in the middle
of a movie shoot in London.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.810
That is not possible.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:44.320
Are you sure?

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:48.560
I heard the attendance at Kaleido Stage
is dropping these days,

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.190
and the operation is getting tough.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:54.490
But I would suggest that
you not stoop so low.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:58.930
Well, sooner or later,
you will find out the truth.

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:03.970
Soon, the airplane will arrive
at Heathrow Airport in London.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:30.820
Cut!

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:44.210
It was wonderful, Layla.

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:46.570
I want to check the cut you shot right now.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.020
Father...

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.480
Are you in London for business?

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:58.660
Yes.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:02.200
Since I had been thinking about showing up
at your movie shoot at least once,

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.600
this was perfect.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:07.000
Maybe you're worried that your
darling only daughter

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.540
might have been mistreated by me?

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.040
I don't mind that at all.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:12.230
Please train her without hesitation.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:13.810
Father...

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:18.570
Then, enjoy.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.690
There's some guy talking nonsense,

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.350
saying that you're appearing
in an amusement park show.

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.490
Who'd say something like that?

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.630
Could it be.... Yuri Killian?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:43.170
When the nonsense rumors start,
they're proof that you're a star.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.640
You don't need to worry about those.

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:58.620
Is Mr. Dio off today?

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:02.180
He's got Theatrical Camp's
daytime performance.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:03.690
When you have a roof,

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.460
I guess it doesn't matter
whether it rains or shines.

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:08.360
If it keeps raining like this
all day long, perhaps,

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.330
we're going to have long-deserved day off.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:11.670
Nope.

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:15.500
We're going to have a review meeting
and rehearsal for a new performance.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:18.040
Yuck! You're a demon for stage.

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:20.530
I understand...

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.940
We'll discuss the schedule in detail later.

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:29.810
Rosetta...

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:35.080
Aren't you squeezing your schedule
too much because of us?

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:38.690
I'm doing all of this because I want to.

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:40.030
So don't worry.

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:41.690
I can handle both schedules well.

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:42.990
Thank you.

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:52.640
You want to buy 2,000
admission tickets per day?

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:55.640
I'm thinking about giving away those tickets

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:57.370
as presents to the audience at Kaleido Stage.

00:07:57.610 --> 00:07:59.050
So, for the time being,

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:01.820
I want to buy 2,000 tickets a day
for three months

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.010
which brings us to a
total of 1 80,000 tickets.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.520
And I want to purchase
those tickets all at once.

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:10.890
1 80,000 tickets...

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:14.260
It looks like this month
will be a rainy month.

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:17.390
As an owner whose business
is affected by the weather,

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:20.260
this deal is a dream come true, but...

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:23.910
Kaleido Stage and my park
are business rivals, so to speak.

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:25.700
Will this deal come with a catch?

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:27.010
Yes.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:28.410
But it's a simple one.

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:33.010
I want you to cancel the
Freedom Lights' performance.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:39.420
They're our park's cash cow now.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:41.910
There's no way I can just give them up.

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:46.490
Even without that Masked Star?

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:47.760
What?!

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:51.800
She may not come here anymore.

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:05.870
Don't worry.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:08.880
It's nice to hear the movie shoot
is going smoothly.

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:12.750
The success of this movie
will decide your future.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.060
It's very important.

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:16.520
That's why I selected the project
very carefully,

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:19.050
and gathered the best staff.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.060
Yes, I know.

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.300
By the end of next week,

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:27.360
we'll finally shoot the big climax scene.

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:29.500
I wish you success.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.810
Thank you.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:53.460
She's not there.

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:58.930
What?!

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.920
The Masked Star is not there?!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.170
It was just like Yuri told me.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:09.940
Fired?!

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:11.310
Wait a minute!

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:13.210
That is different
from the contract we signed.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.950
That's my line!

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:15.980
Listen,

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:19.320
the fact that the Masked Star
is not a formal member

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:22.050
is a serious breach of contract!

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:23.830
Really...

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:26.350
I'm glad Yuri Killian told me this.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:27.330
What?

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:28.420
Yuri did?

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:29.630
Nothing.

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:31.390
Get out of here.

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:34.560
Mr. Yuri...

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:40.640
Damn that Yuri...

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:43.210
I can't believe he's sunk so low!

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:46.740
I heard that Kaleido Stage
is losing a lot of its audience.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.350
So I'm afraid that the presence of
Freedom Lights is getting in his way.

00:10:49.720 --> 00:10:51.340
Just because we're getting in his way...

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.920
But, because of this,
I understand something well.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:55.790
What?

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:59.390
We're still missing something.

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:04.630
Then what are we going go to do now?

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.190
Are we going back to the life
of working part-time again?

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:12.100
I wonder if we still can make it to that one.

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:14.200
"That one"?

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:20.010
Vancouver World Performance Festival?

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:20.950
Yes.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:24.320
Around the year before last,
I participated in their exhibition.

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.550
Oh, I know. If we get a good reputation,

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:29.660
Marine Park's owner
may reconsider firing us.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:30.560
Not good.

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:32.260
The pre-screening deadline
has already passed.

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:33.390
Oh...

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:36.630
But with your talents,

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:38.460
I think they can waive the
pre-screening process.

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:40.440
I'll talk to them and see what they can do.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.230
What?!

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:42.900
What?

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:45.370
PLEASE!

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:46.570
Okay!

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.140
Rosetta, you're amazing!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:48.980
Really.

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:50.250
You're a big shot!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:51.940
I don't want to make an enemy of you.

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.010
Okay. Let's call everyone and practice.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.260
The reversed Magician:

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:06.090
the enemy's trap.

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:08.030
What?!

00:12:08.030 --> 00:12:10.550
You don't need to permit their participation!

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:13.770
I can't believe they'd apply for a festival

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:15.600
in which I'm participating as special advisor.

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:17.510
Oh, wait...

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:20.700
Maybe they're not aware that I'm involved.

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:24.140
Fine. Give them permission.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:52.240
In short, you're saying that Marine Park's
show was canceled because of Yuri.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.740
Yes. Probably...

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:59.150
And I researched a little.

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:03.740
Yesterday, Freedom Lights entered
Vancouver's Performance Festival.

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:07.720
Isn't that the festival in which my father
is supposed to participate as a judge?

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:11.590
Yes. Yuri Killian is also involved
as a special advisor.

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:15.760
I have a hunch this will be bad.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:20.370
I already canceled the flights
between San Francisco and Los Angeles.

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:21.840
Thank you for everything.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.770
You're welcome.
I'm on your side, Miss Layla.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.540
Thank you.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.710
I hope filming goes well.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:30.510
Thank you.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:35.510
By the way, when is the Vancouver festival?

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:37.350
It's this weekend.

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:39.050
This weekend...

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:43.110
We'll finally shoot the big climax scene.

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:53.860
You were the best partner.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.330
Thanks.

00:13:58.370 --> 00:13:59.840
I don't want to lose.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:06.780
I don't want to lose.

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:10.180
Today, there was a new movement.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:15.550
A local popular performance team called "Z"
suddenly entered the festival.

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:17.930
"Z, " if I remember correctly,

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:20.050
is an amateur street
performance team. Right?

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:23.690
Yes. It seems an amateur team's
participation is very rare.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.600
Also, I'm concerned that their
scheduled performance

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:28.160
is similar to Freedom Lights' performance.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:31.900
Cut!

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:33.540
What's wrong, Layla?

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:34.680
Is something on your mind?

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.470
Sorry, would you mind
if I ask you to do one more take?

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:40.240
Let's take a quick break.

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:44.450
When I called their office,

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:45.790
they said that their performance
will not be affected

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:48.350
even if the number of registrants
changes on the day of performance.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:14:58.600
What's this?

00:14:58.600 --> 00:14:59.530
"Z"?

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:03.160
An acrobatic Performance Team
from Vancouver.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:06.670
The contents of their show
are exactly the same as ours.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:08.240
What?

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.370
Do you want to back out?

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:18.450
Please don't give me that scary glare.

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:21.080
Because I'm part of this festival's staff.

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:22.620
What?

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:27.180
"Z" is a group of local street performers
here in Vancouver.

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:29.920
I scouted them out and suggested
that they participate in this.

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:35.100
I want to give an opportunity
to a talented group of people.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:39.410
If you have confidence in your performance,

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.570
you should have no problems.

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:42.740
Moreover, your opponents are amateurs.

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:46.210
I know you will never lose to amateurs.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:08.300
The following is a local street
performance team from Vancouver, "Z"!

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:20.280
Wow...

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:21.770
They're popular.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:33.780
This is...

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:38.220
It's the same as ours.

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:39.930
Did they copy us?

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:47.670
Not only that, they improved it a little
and made it more dynamic.

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:51.710
I will announce to the mass media

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:55.310
that Freedom Lights copied
Z's performance without permission.

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:58.280
Then their life will be over.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:02.710
It sounds like fun. I don't mind doing it.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:04.390
If everything goes well,

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:07.520
I will welcome all of you to Kaleido Stage
under special conditions.

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:10.330
Sorry, but we don't want to be restricted.

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:23.600
They're getting wonderful cheers...

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:25.810
We can't afford to be beat by those guys!

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:32.010
Now what are we gonna do?

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:38.560
All right, I understand.

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:40.650
I will postpone the shoot until next week.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:47.320
In return, I expect the
best performance out of you.

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:03.740
Now, the following is
Freedom Lights from L.A.!

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:28.640
The Masked Star...

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.880
Do you know what you're doing?

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.440
Yuri, thank you for the flowers.

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:22.030
Don't get in my way!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:39.640
Miss Layla!

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:44.280
Well... What shall we do about the festival?

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:48.650
Layla Hamilton is not a
professional performer now.

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:51.160
Therefore, they're disqualified.

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:04.670
Layla!

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:08.970
Why are you here?

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:12.340
Today is supposed to be the day
for the climax shoot.

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:15.120
I asked them to postpone the shoot.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:16.210
What?

00:20:16.850 --> 00:20:19.320
I'm aware that I'm selfish.

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:21.820
But I couldn't just stand by and do nothing.

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:27.320
Why? I don't understand
what on earth you're thinking.

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:37.040
Sorry, I told myself that
I would never disappoint you. But...

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:41.400
This time, I couldn't help myself.

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:45.740
That's just how much
my friends here mean to me.

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:48.550
Miss Layla...

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:49.550
And...

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:53.490
I realized that I still have
something left to do on stage.

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:55.250
I want to perform a perfect...

00:20:57.390 --> 00:21:03.260
a perfect performance that
makes me fully satisfied.

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:06.930
I want to receive the applause
that makes my whole body tremble.

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:15.000
And right now, I have a partner
who can make it possible.

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:17.810
Miss Layla!

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:24.280
I've not finished my last show.

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:29.090
In any case, make sure
to finish the movie shoot.

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:31.930
After that, do whatever you want.

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.620
Father.

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:37.090
How was my performance today?

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:49.570
Don't you need to run after your father?

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:52.950
It's all right.

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.010
It's a path we had to go down
someday anyway.

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:56.950
Miss Layla...

00:22:05.430 --> 00:22:06.360
What?

00:22:06.890 --> 00:22:08.690
What? What?

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:19.440
Can you see me?

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:22.040
Next Kaleido Star

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:23.880
What? That's impossible.

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:25.080
There is no way you can do that maneuver.

00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:28.380
And so, surprisingly,
even Miss Layla can see Fool!

00:22:28.520 --> 00:22:29.350
This means...

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:31.550
The legendary great maneuver...
It sounds wonderful.

00:22:31.550 --> 00:22:32.990
But, what kind of maneuver is it?

00:22:32.990 --> 00:22:34.790
Finally, breaking free of the past,

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:36.760
Kalos ends his silence
and begins to take action!

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:39.030
The legendary great maneuver;
the details are...

00:22:39.030 --> 00:22:40.430
The details are! The details are!

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:42.930
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"The Legendary Amazing Maneuver"

00:22:42.930 --> 00:22:45.300
The Legendary Amazing Maneuver

00:22:42.930 --> 00:22:45.300
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"The Legendary Amazing Maneuver"

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:45.670
The Legendary Amazing Maneuver

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:51.310
The Legendary Amazing Maneuver

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:51.310
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...

00:22:51.310 --> 00:23:04.020
<i>Boku wa koko ni iru
sora to michi no aida de mukai kaze</i>

00:22:51.310 --> 00:23:04.020
<i>I'm here between the sky and the roads,
and facing against the wind</i>

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:17.900
<i>Soshite mae o muiteiru
mou nido to kanashimi ga furanai youni to</i>

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:17.900
<i>And I'm facing forward so the sorrow
doesn't rain down ever again</i>

00:23:17.900 --> 00:23:23.840
<i>Ano kabe o koete kokomade kitanda</i>

00:23:17.900 --> 00:23:23.840
<i>I came all the way here after
I jumped over that wall</i>

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:31.150
<i>Nigedashitaku naru koto wa nando mo aru</i>

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:31.150
<i>There are many times
when I just want to run away</i>

00:23:31.150 --> 00:23:36.480
<i>Dakedo kokoni irunara taishite bibitte inai</i>

00:23:31.150 --> 00:23:36.480
<i>But I'm still here,
so, I'm not daunted that much</i>

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:43.920
<i>Kakinaguri no uta "hajimekara yareba iisa"</i>

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:43.920
<i>The poem I scribbled down, I can just
start writing over from the beginning</i>

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:49.490
<i>Umaku kakenaku te boku wa waratte iru</i>

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:49.490
<i>Unable to write it well, I'm laughing</i>
